rows.en:
Something like cotton fluff that had been packed inside burst out and scattered.
It wasn't cotton fluff.
They were tiny flying bugs{f:!|!}
The wheezing had been the sound of {f:these things rubbing together inside his body|them rubbing together inside his body}.{p}

{f:No|No}!
{f:I don't|I don't} want to die like this☆
{f:I|I} looked up at the sky, begging for help.{p}

Rising heat haze and orange flames against a deep navy sky full of stars.
The sight of {f:our|our} lives burning away was beautiful beyond words.
As I watched it, {f:my|my} consciousness sank into darkness……{p}

Then Kazama turned back to {f:us|us} and said this:
"You'd better call this project off right here."
With that, he left the room.{p}

One of the girls handed Arai a handkerchief{f:, but|, but} the bleeding {f:was|was} far too heavy for that to stop it.
Maybe we should just call it a night here……
The thought crossed my mind.{p}

Paying no attention to {f:me|me} as I sat there stunned, Arai turned to the others.
"Now then, next person, please tell your story.
The seventh one isn't coming, so the sixth story may be the last.{p}
